                     /label="Sun1"
                     /note="SUN1_MOUSE - Also known as Unc84a. Experimental evidence at protein level: Swiss-Prot protein existence level 1. Isoform 5 may be involved in nuclear remodeling during sperm head formation in spermatogenenis. A probable SUN1 isoform 5:SYNE3 LINC complex may tether spermatid nuclei to anterior cytoskeletal structures such as actin filaments present at membraneous junctions of spermatids and Sertoli cells. From Mus musculus (Mouse).; pLannotate 99.1% identity"
